2.2 Shared components checklist
•	Header (3 tiers): announcement bar → logo / category search / support & account / cart badge → primary nav with 'Order Via Prescription' CTA
•	Footer (dark navy): brand blurb, link columns, newsletter input, socials, payment icons
•	Trust features bar (4 icons) used above the footer on every page
•	Product card (grid + list variants) with badge slot, rating, price block, hover actions
•	Quantity stepper (used in list cards, PDP, cart, cart drawer)
•	Breadcrumb + page-title header block used on all inner pages
•	Modals: sign in (21), register (22), search overlay (23), newsletter (24), subscription history (20)
•	Drawers: filter drawer left (09), quick view right (11), mini cart right (13)
•	Account sidebar navigation (17–20 share one component with an active-item state)
•	Pagination component (06, 07, 08, 27)
