4. Recommended Build Order
1. Tokens & shared library — colours, badges, product card, qty stepper, trust bar, footer, header, breadcrumb header (from 06/10).
2. Navigation states — mega menu (25) and category flyout (26); mobile drawer accordion.
3. Auth — modals 21/22 and the login gate 15.
4. Catalog — 06 grid + 08 list + 07 badges; filter panel as sidebar/drawer (09); toolbar with pills, sort, view switcher, pagination.
5. Product — PDP 10 with tabs, subscription radio and cross-sell; quick view 11.
6. Purchase — cart page 12, mini-cart drawer 13, checkout 14 (both Rx-upload states).
7. Prescription path — uploader 16 and its landing in account 18.
8. Account — shell + orders 17, subscriptions 19 + history modal 20.
9. Content & marketing — blog 27/28, about 29, contact 30, FAQs 31, legal 32, search overlay 23, newsletter popup 24.
10. Homepage — assemble 01 last so every section it references already exists; borrow modules from 02–05 as needed.
5. Gaps — What the Kit Does NOT Cover (design separately)
•	Mobile & tablet designs: only 1920 px desktop is captured; define all responsive behaviour yourself.
•	Homepage variants: build one (recommended 01); 02–05 are reference libraries, not separate pages.
•	Checkout 'uploaded prescription' visual state was deduplicated out — rebuild the filled state from section 14's description.
•	Missing pages: order-success/thank-you, 404, search-results page, product compare, account dashboard home, wishlist page, order-tracking detail.
•	Missing states: empty cart, empty order history, validation errors, sold-out products, logged-out account access.
•	Email templates (order confirmation, Rx approval, subscription reminders) and transactional SMS.
•	Design-token / style-guide file: extract exact hex values, type scale and spacing from the PNGs during build.
•	Localisation & accessibility passes (contrast, focus states, aria for drawers/modals/tabs) and Rx-compliance review for your market.
